                                "sense_id": "91718608-6f1f-38bc-83a5-a7c9fc2c1e67",
                                "text": "Perhaps in today’s hectic news environment, America will have forgotten by Election Day that the Democrats knowingly armed themselves with a penknife for a gunfight — and won’t ask whether such a party should be trusted on its promises to reconfigure the entire society.",
                                "translation": "La traduction en français de l’exemple manque. (Ajouter)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b99bb8f9-1a67-4f1f-a701-ba773e142f9c",
                                "sense_id": "91718608-6f1f-38bc-83a5-a7c9fc2c1e67",
                                "text": "I did discover that, as well as the penknife, Emma also carried a ball of string, which is a marvellous idea.",
                                "translation": "J'ai découvert qu'en plus du canif, Emma portait aussi une pelote de ficelle avec elle, ce qui est une idée merveilleuse."
                            }
